# Contributing

This is a solo practitioner's repo. Pull requests are welcome to read and
learn from, but are not actively reviewed or merged — fork it and make it
yours rather than waiting on a review here.

## If you find a bug or have a question

Open an issue. It may not get a response quickly, or at all, but it's read.

## If you want to build on this

Fork it. Under this repo's license (see `LICENSE`[ and `LICENSE-CONTENT`
if the repo splits code and content]), you're free to adapt it[, with the
condition that a share-alike adaptation stays open in turn — see the
license file for the exact terms].

